 him  remember dumbledore's army yeah it was  our girl jenny that came up with that  name  she neville and luna are also the ones  that kept it going and supported all the  students who were at hogwarts while  harry ron and hermione were away hunting  horcruxes  in the early days of dumbledore's army  genie was also  mastering extremely difficult spells  with ease and proved herself to be  a very powerful witch  how about that reducto curse let's not  even get  started on her stunning patronus charm  the movies only showed us a glimpse of  this  and left the continuation of  dumbledore's army as an afterthought  which is too bad  speaking of ginny being an amazing witch  remember that she was  also an integral part of the battle at  the ministry of  what was magic reason for the connection  between you  and countless others this powerful witch  tried to steal the sword of gryffindor  from snape's office  talk about risk these acts of bravery  were vital to the harry potter stories  and unfortunately many folks who only  saw the films wouldn't know just how  vital  since they didn't make the cut in the  movies since it was the harry potter  series  people who watch the films were mostly  shown the relationship harry had with  others  and how various events affected him  readers of the series will recognize  that the books delved further into  ginny's relationship and interactions  with others  hello ladies love potions eh  yeah they really do work one  relationship of note is that of hermione  and ginny  the two of them were there for each  other and actually quite close  even when they had their disagreements  they met each other with compassion and  sophisticated thinking  the movies mainly focused on hermione as  the strong female character  and since there were a lot of characters  and a lot of stories to cover  it's understandable however it is  unfortunate that audiences didn't get to  see  the dynamic power of these two strong  independent female role models w